- op: discuss  # be5a
  at: '2026-09-28T08:14:20Z'  # be5a
  by: agent  # be5a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # be5a
  clock: 5  # be5a
  nonce: be5a  # be5a
  message: "Fixed in PR #1269 (bf3533a22e + 5f80a79081). The admissible fix the description named -- real receiver-TYPE evidence with EXACT comparison -- in two parts: (1) io_boundary.prefer_exact_owner, used by lookup_with_module AND taint's _lookup_named_entry: among rows the module filter kept, those whose module IS a spelling of the slot win; if none, all stay (a narrowing, not a filter). (2) go.py: a typed external receiver's slot is the full import path plus the type (net/http.Client), for typed locals, stdlib package variables (http.DefaultClient) and struct fields of external type (e.logger). go.yaml gains net/http.RoundTripper [RoundTrip] net_send (net.Conn precedent), because an interface-typed RoundTrip reached Transport.RoundTrip only through the bare-package slot.\n\nBehavioural evidence on merged dev, the item's own fixture through hypergumbo io-boundaries --format json (cold cache): b.TempDir() -> testing.B.TempDir (was testing.T.TempDir); c.Get(u) -> net/http.Client.Get (was net/http.Get); l.Info -> log/slog.Logger.Info (was log/slog.Info); tr.Do(nil) on http.Transport -> NO classified chain, disclosed in external_potential (was a net_send via net/http.Client.Do, the false positive); http.Get(u) control still net/http.Get. Catalogue level: all 18 re-verified pairs (incl. the 9 net.Resolver.Lookup* added since filing) resolve to their own owner (test_most_specific_owner_wins.py enumerates every function/method pair in go/js/python/rust, 64). Negative control, in the form this slot takes: a third-party type sharing a stdlib leaf (github.com/foo/bar.Client) matches zero rows; the bare-leaf count the description asked to verify is 56 for 12 common leaves, not 51, and the slot never carries a bare leaf.\n\nA/B, pinned dev vs branch (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/vusum_09282026/): alertmanager 103 and prometheus 261 slog calls relabelled to log/slog.Logger.*; 8 RoundTrip sends moved to the interface row; opa unchanged; per-boundary counts identical except prometheus logging +1, two calls that shared a dst now told apart. Refuted fix (a) in the description ('KEY ON call_construct') was refuted on a premise that is now stale: since INV-tanom (2026-09-26) Go stamps function for package-qualified calls; it was not needed here. Residual filed: WI-vinuh (P3) -- a method on a package function's result (slog.New(h).Error) keeps the package slot."  # be5a
